# Agent git worktrees are full nested checkouts of this repo (see `git worktree
# list`). Their copies of docs/ui-ref/ etc. are already ignored below, but those
# patterns are root-anchored and don't reach into a nested worktree — so a stale
# worktree made local `format:check` fail on 26 files CI never sees, because it
# is untracked. Ignoring the whole directory keeps local agreeing with CI.
.claude/
package-lock.json
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
prisma/migrations/
docs/ui-ref/
docs/ui-ref-revised/

# Hand-crafted prose/tables — Prettier's markdown table reformatting pads every
